 "intro": {
  "text": "The Scotch Game starts 1.e4 e5 2.Nf3 Nc6 3.d4. Instead of building up slowly, White opens the centre at once, and after 3...exd4 4.Nxd4 a white knight stands in the centre of the board. Black will attack that knight, so your job is to keep it guarded while you bring out your pieces and castle."
 },
